<workout_file>
  <author>Xtri training coach</author>
  <name>R08 Hill 8x90</name>
  <description>Bakke Tjeldbergtind prep. — Run: Power = fraction of threshold RUN pace (pace=2 ≈ 10k/threshold reference). Set run threshold pace in TP Zones — not bike FTP. TP Workout Library ZWO import is bike-only; use Workout Builder for run or sync from calendar.</description>
